    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if our village is almost self-sufficient right now, an unforeseen Catastrophe could easily wipe everything out in one fell swoop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "The first couple months saw that happen again and again, and it took much trial-and-error for us to make it here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "But these peaceful days won't last long. I once believed that after our long journey, we'd have more companions leave us than remain. I never would've thought our group would grow larger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's not because we ran into more oppressed people. It's because those who chose us haven't lost faith in us, even if they ought to have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we've done is show them a bit of kindness, and most of them chose to give unconditional trust in return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even after they've felt the pain of survival time and again, their barren lands can still yield these emotions more precious than gold?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't... After all that, I can't even imagine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why I started to think... What if it's just how everything is supposed to unfold? This is the truth that these humblest people believe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "They fall down, then get back up. They fail, and they start over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your point?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "text": "We <i>will</i> fail again, Nine, but I think we don't have to fear this anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "br",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
