        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah. Nine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's urgent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1983_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Red? It's not like you to look so nervous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_328_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran into a group of refugees near the village. They said they're miners who escaped the Far North, and they're here cause they've heard tell of Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "text": "I checked them over. They're unarmed, and they're all Infected. I had them wait at the sentry post. We need you to decide what to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the Far North? We haven't heard much from there. What do you mean, they 'escaped?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_328_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, not much intel ever leaks out of there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for what happened... maybe it's better you hear it from them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks... Thanks for taking us in, kind lady, mister... Are you the Reunion Movement we heard about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never would've thought... what Rankin told us was true... My goodness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Slow down. We are Reunion, and we will do what we can to help all our suffering comrades.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1968_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could you please tell us what you've been through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
